      "result": "<task id=\"ses_f4f80b629ffeDEx5hQXyZq6ymC\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nResearch complete. Here is the factual report.\n\n---\n\n# Calendar front-end UI in Twenty CRM (`packages/twenty-front`)\n\n## 0. Top-level finding: there is no `modules/calendar/` and no calendar route\n\n- `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/` **does not exist**.\n- There is **no `AppPath.Calendar`** and **no `/calendar` route**. The full route enum lives in `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/src/types/AppPath.ts` (only `RecordIndexPage = '/objects/:objectNamePlural'`, `RecordShowPage`, `PageLayoutPage`, `TasksPage`, `OpportunitiesPage`, etc.).\n- Calendar is implemented as a **view layout** (`ViewType.CALENDAR` / `ViewType.CALENDAR_WIDGET`), not a page. `ViewType` enum: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/src/types/ViewType.ts`.\n- There are **two separate calendar UIs**:\n  1. **Generic record calendar** (grid, any object with a Date/DateTime field): `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/`.\n  2. **Calendar-events agenda/list** for a record's related events (the \"Calendar\" record-page widget / timeline): `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/calendar/`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Where is the calendar UI? (day/week/month vs. event list)\n\nBoth exist, in different subsystems.\n\n### A. Generic record calendar grid — Day / Week / Month\n- Entry: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-index/components/RecordIndexContainer.tsx` (line 65: `recordIndexViewType === ViewType.CALENDAR` → `RecordIndexCalendarContainer`).\n- Wrapper: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-index/components/RecordIndexCalendarContainer.tsx` → `RecordCalendarContainer`.\n- Container: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/components/RecordCalendarContainer.tsx`.\n- Main view: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/components/RecordCalendar.tsx`.\n- Dashboard widget variant: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar-widget/components/RecordCalendarWidget.tsx` (default `isReadOnly = true`).\n\nLayouts are `ViewCalendarLayout` = `DAY | WEEK | MONTH`:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-shared/src/types/ViewCalendarLayout.ts`\n- State default MONTH: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-index/states/recordIndexCalendarLayoutComponentState.ts`\n\n### B. Calendar-events agenda/list (month-grouped list, not a grid)\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/calendar/components/CalendarEventsCardContent.tsx` — groups events by month → day.\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/calendar/components/CalendarMonthCard.tsx`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/calendar/components/CalendarDayCardContent.tsx`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/calendar/components/CalendarEventRow.tsx`\n- Data hook: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/calendar/hooks/useCalendarEvents.ts`\n- Container: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/activities/calendar/components/CalendarEventsCard.tsx`\n- Widget wrapper: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/page-layout/widgets/calendar/components/CalendarWidget.tsx`\n\nThere is **no dedicated CalendarEvent page** under `src/pages/`; it is the generic record page (`RecordShowPage` / side panel record page), reachable via `CoreObjectNameSingular.CalendarEvent`.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Components rendering calendar events / calendars\n\n**No FullCalendar dependency.** Searches for `FullCalendar`, `@fullcalendar`, `CalendarMonthView`, `CalendarWeekView`, `CalendarDayView` returned **no matches**. The grid is custom-built on `@dnd-kit/react`.\n\nRecord-calendar grid:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/grid/components/RecordCalendarGrid.tsx`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/grid/components/RecordCalendarGridDay.tsx`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/record-calendar-card/components/RecordCalendarCard.tsx`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/record-calendar-card/components/RecordCalendarCardBody.tsx`\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/record-calendar-card/components/RecordCalendarCardDraggableContainer.tsx`\n- DnD context: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/components/RecordCalendarDragDropContext.tsx`\n- Layout switcher (Day/Week/Month + prev/today/next + date picker + timezone label): `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/components/RecordCalendarTopBar.tsx`\n- Layout switcher in the view options dropdown: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/object-options-dropdown/components/ObjectOptionsDropdownCalendarViewContent.tsx` (Day/Week/Month, plus a **disabled \"Timeline\" with a \"Soon\" pill**).\n\nCalendar-event components (`modules/activities/calendar/components/`):\n- `CalendarEventsCard.tsx`, `CalendarEventsCardContent.tsx`, `CalendarMonthCard.tsx`, `CalendarDayCardContent.tsx`, `CalendarEventRow.tsx`\n- `CalendarEventParticipantsAvatarGroup.tsx`, `CalendarEventCallRecorderAvatar.tsx`\n- `CalendarEventNotSharedContent.tsx` (shown when channel visibility is metadata-only)\n- `CalendarEventComposerFields.tsx`, `CalendarEventComposerTargetsInput.tsx`, `CalendarEventLocationInput.tsx`\n- Types/context: `modules/activities/calendar/types/CalendarEvent.ts`, `contexts/CalendarContext.ts`\n\n---\n\n## 3. Create / edit / delete capabilities\n\n### Generic record calendar (any object)\n- **Create**: yes, but via a hover \"+\" button in a day cell, not drag-to-create.\n  - `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/components/RecordCalendarAddNew.tsx` (calls `createNewIndexRecord`, seeds the calendar date field).\n- **Edit**: yes, inline per-field editing.\n  - `RecordCalendarCardBody.tsx` wires `FieldContext` + `RecordInlineCell` with `updateOneRecord`.\n  - Edit/hover portals: `.../record-calendar-card/anchored-portal/components/RecordCalendarCardCellEditModePortal.tsx`, `RecordCalendarCardCellHoveredPortal.tsx`.\n- **Move**: drag-and-drop between day cells (moves the record's date/datetime; no resize/edge-drag, no drag-to-create).\n  - `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/hooks/useRecordCalendarDndKit.ts`\n  - `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-drag/hooks/useProcessCalendarCardDrop.ts` (calls `updateOneRecord`, shifts date/datetime).\n  - Date-shift utils: `modules/object-record/record-drag/utils/getShiftedRecordCalendar{Date,DateTime,DateUpdateInput,DateTimeUpdateInput}.ts`\n- **Delete**: no calendar-specific delete; right-click opens the generic record-index command menu (`RecordCalendarCard.tsx` `handleContextMenuOpen` → `commandMenuId`).\n- **Read-only guards**: `modules/object-record/record-calendar/states/isRecordCalendarReadOnlyComponentState.ts`, `record-calendar-widget/components/RecordCalendarWidgetReadOnlyEffect.tsx`, `record-calendar-card/hooks/useIsRecordCalendarCardDragDisabled.ts`