axaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/settings/accounts/components/`:\n- `SettingsAccountsCalendarChannelsContainer.tsx` (tab per channel)\n- `SettingsAccountsCalendarChannelDetails.tsx` — **Event visibility** + **Contact auto-creation** toggles. It calls `UPDATE_CALENDAR_CHANNEL` (`{ visibility, isContactAutoCreationEnabled }`). The prop type includes `isSyncEnabled`, but the component does **not render a sync/enable toggle** (the field is fetched only).\n- `SettingsAccountsCalendarVisibilitySettingsCard.tsx` (exported as `SettingsAccountsEventVisibilitySettingsCard`) — options `CalendarChannelVisibility.SHARE_EVERYTHING` (\"Everything\") / `METADATA` (\"Metadata\").\n- `SettingsAccountsCalendarDisplaySettings.tsx` — time zone, date format, time format selects.\n- Mutation: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/settings/accounts/graphql/mutations/updateCalendarChannel.ts`\n- Query: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/settings/accounts/graphql/queries/getMyCalendarChannels.ts`\n- Hook: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/settings/accounts/hooks/useMyCalendarChannels.ts`\n- Channel type: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/accounts/types/CalendarChannel.ts`\n- Account-level sync status display: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/settings/accounts/components/SettingsAccountsConnectedAccountsRowRightContainer.tsx`\n- CalDAV connection form mentions calendar sync: `SettingsAccountsConnectionForm.tsx` (lines ~328–329).\n\n---\n\n## 5. Recurrence / attendee / timezone handling\n\n### Recurrence\n- **No recurrence UI anywhere** (searched `recurrence|recurring|RRULE` in `activities/calendar` → none). No \"repeat\" picker in the composer.\n- Recurrence exists only server-side as sync metadata: `recurringEventExternalId` on `calendarChannelEventAssociation` (`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E